Copyright in Sipral is held in full by:

    Tiberiu Balasea

Every source and documentation file carries a copyright line naming that
holder, next to its SPDX licence identifier. Sole ownership is what makes the
dual licence in LICENSING.md possible: only the holder of all rights can offer
the same code under a commercial arm.

External code contributions are not accepted before 1.0. After that they are
accepted only under a contributor licence agreement that grants the holder above
a perpetual, worldwide, irrevocable, non-exclusive and sublicensable licence to
the contribution. That agreement is not written yet; it will be published in
CONTRIBUTING.md before the first patch is taken. Issues, test captures and
interoperability reports are welcome at any time and are not code
contributions.
